<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq" class="sec bg-slate-50" data-section="faq">
 <div class="container-narrow">
 {{ sectionHeader('FAQ', '3-in-1 Station <span class="text-brandOrange">FAQ</span>', '', {max: ''}) }}
 <div class="reveal">
 {% call faqItem("What is the MOQ for 3-in-1 wireless charging stations?", true) %}Standard ODM models with custom logo: MOQ <strong>500 units</strong>. ODM new-design development: <strong>1,000-2,000 units</strong>. OEM with new tooling: <strong>3,000+ units</strong>. Sample turnaround: 3-7 days.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("Do your 3-in-1 chargers support Samsung and Apple devices simultaneously?", true) %}Yes. Our 3-in-1 charging docks support simultaneous fast charging for iPhone (15W/25W Qi2 MPP) or Samsung Galaxy (15W Qi), Apple Watch (2.5-5W), and AirPods/TWS (5W). Qi2 universal standard means both ecosystems charge at full speed without MFi licensing fees.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("What is the difference between the 15W and 25W models?", true) %}15W models (WOW82, WOW90, WOW93, WOW98, WOW83, WOW91) use Qi2 MPP standard for iPhone 12-16 and Android Qi2 devices. <strong>25W models (WOW122, WOW133, WOW125, WOW115, WOW10, WOW18, WOW19)</strong> use Qi v2.2.1 extended power profile for Pixel 10, Galaxy S25, and iPhone 16. All 25W models include active cooling (fan or TEC semiconductor) to maintain sustained max-speed output without thermal throttling.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("What certifications do your 3-in-1 stations have?") %}All models are WPC Qi2 certified, CE (EMC + Low Voltage Directive) for EU, FCC Part 15 for US, and RoHS compliant. Qi2 certification means 99.2% ATL (Authorized Test Lab) pass rate — each model passes magnetic alignment accuracy and power delivery consistency testing. Full certification documentation provided with every OEM order.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("Can I get custom colors and materials for 3-in-1 stations?") %}Yes. Full CMF (Color/Material/Finish) customization for OEM/ODM orders: aluminum alloy, zinc alloy, ABS+PC in custom Pantone-matched colors, glass surfaces, and silicone finishes. Custom packaging and logo printing included. MOQ 2,000 for full CMF; 500 for logo-only OEM.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("Are your 3-in-1 stations suitable for hotel and hospitality use?") %}Yes. WOW90 (zinc alloy + night light), WOW18 (night-light cube), and WOW83 (detachable watch + acrylic light) are specifically designed for hotel bedside use. Durable construction, universal Qi2 compatibility, and bulk hospitality pricing from 1,000+ units with custom engraving. 17.5M hotel rooms globally — hospitality tech market growing at 10.2% CAGR.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("How long does OEM/ODM production take for 3-in-1 stations?") %}OEM (standard models with custom logo): <strong>25-30 days</strong> after sample approval. ODM (custom enclosure design): <strong>45-60 days</strong> including tooling. Both timelines include 4-stage QC (IQC → IPQC → FQC → OQC) with 4-hour 100% aging test before shipping. Express air freight: 5-7 days to EU/US. Seafreight: 25-35 days.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("Do you offer private label 3-in-1 charging stations?") %}Yes. WOWOHCOOL is a direct factory — no trading company markup. Private label OEM includes custom logo (silkscreen/laser/UV), Pantone-matched colors, custom retail packaging, and multi-language manuals. MOQ 500 units. We also support private label for Amazon FBA sellers with FNSKU-ready barcode printing and frustration-free packaging.{% endcall %}
 </div>
 </div>
</section>

